   "body": "Thanks to westlinkin for the report and skygunner for the earlier patch direction. I reproduced the same direct-session pricing gap for `kimi-code/k3.1-pro` on **v0.1.4332** and prepared an alternative that also covers the no-saved-provider and pricing-precedence cases.\n\n**Branch:** https://github.com/VectorLu/magpie/tree/fix/kimi-code-session-price  \n**Commit:** `d7b551199`, based on **v0.1.4335**. skygunner is credited as co-author.\n\nGitHub refuses PR creation for my account (`CreatePullRequest`, collaborators only), so I am leaving the branch here for maintainer review, as with the earlier community patch.\n\n## What changes\n\n- A local session's `<provider>/<model>` name is resolved without changing the row's provider or displayed model.\n- Explicit `kimi-code/` and `kimi-code-cn/` prefixes use the existing `kimiCodeAPI` mapping even with no saved provider.\n- Full-model user prices stay first, Served-model pricing is preserved, and each cached price keeps its own rate windows.\n- Historical rows are re-priced on read; no log migration.\n\n## Verification\n\nNew regressions are red before the fix and green after:\n\n- `TestKimiCodeSessionCost`: API price without a saved provider, plus full-model, provider-wide and any-provider custom prices.\n- `TestSessionPriceWindowsStayWithTheirModel`: A→B→A keeps the correct rate window.\n- `TestSessionServedModelPricePrecedesProviderPrefix`: the served model keeps priority.\n\nOn **v0.1.4335**, Go **1.26.8**, macOS arm64:\n\n- `go test ./internal/usage ./internal/sessions ./internal/usageapi`\n- Kimi provider price tests\n- Targeted `go test -race ./internal/usage` for the three regressions\n- `go vet ./...`, `GOOS=linux go vet -tags nogui ./...`, `GOOS=windows go vet ./...`\n- macOS, Linux and Windows builds\n- `gofmt` and `git diff --check`\n\nThe full `go test -tags nogui ./...` run was started but stopped before completion, so no full-suite result is claimed. GUI tests were not run; no GUI assets change.\n\nA real local build was checked against existing Kimi Code sessions: **371 calls went from all unpriced to $38.22 at effective prices**.\n\n**Before — v0.1.4332**\n\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/VectorLu/magpie/pr-assets-kimi-code-session-price/kimi-code-session-price/before.png\" width=\"900\" alt=\"Before: 371 Kimi Code calls are unpriced\">\n\n**After — local build with this change**\n\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/VectorLu/magpie/pr-assets-kimi-code-session-price/kimi-code-session-price/after.png\" width=\"900\" alt=\"After: the same 371 calls total $38.22 at effective prices\">\n",
